'''Juri''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event/Blue Team Gacha Drop|Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

