|name1 = Juri
|name2 = Juri CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Juri CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Juri is an amazing backline DPS and crowd-controller. To start, her stats are very good; at Lv.30, she has a DPS of 12,000 against her target traits. Against Behemoths and Colossus enemies, this number shoots up to 30,000 and 19,200 DPS respectively, which are absurdly high numbers for a Lv.30 unit. Through [[Strong Against]], her bulk is equally as impressive, boasting 110,500 effective HP (once again, made even higher against Behemoths and Colossus). This gives her damage and HP viability in all stages of the game.

The uptime on Juri's [[Freeze]]/[[Slow]] is approximately 30%/75% if all three attacks land, which is unbelievably good and matches many dedicated crowd-controllers like [[Yuletide Nurse (Uber Rare Cat)|Yuletide Nurse]] and [[Trickster Himeyuri (Uber Rare Cat)|Fox Queen Himeyuri]]. This gives her an extremely versatile role compression, all for a relatively cheap cost and low recharge rate.

Her matchups against ordinary enemies are also great, as Juri can counter most melee and midranged threats with complete ease. [[Immune to Waves|Immunity to Waves]] even facilitates matchups against [[Pigeon de Sable]], [[Bun Bun Symbiote]], [[Youcan]], and other threats in mixed stages. [[Immune to Weaken|Immunity to Weaken]] is more situational, but still lets her shrug off encounters with [[Calamary]] and [[Winged Pigge]] whenever relevant.

Against Behemoths, she is a hard counter to [[Angelic Beast Rajakong]], capable of holding him in place whilst efficiently dispatching him. [[Pterowl Hazuku]] is generally less favorable, since she isn't Immune to Surges and can be picked off relatively easily without getting much done. In [[Gauntlet|Colossus Gauntlets]], she's able to hold her own against [[Archangel Exiel]], being immune to the [[Bore Jr.]]'s Mini-Waves. However, she struggles in [[Mega Menace/On Mighty Wings Lv1~20|On Mighty Wings Lv11~20]] because she can't outrange [[Mega-Mooth]], who is supported by nasty Zombie peons that can simply demolish her with brute strength.

Overall, Juri is a very good Uber to aim for!

